  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Education &amp; Food for 50 Orphan Children in Kenya</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Hope Children&apos;s Home situated in the Kawangware slum of Nairobi, hosts 50 orphaned and abandoned children. On a very limited budget, the home provides upkeep and accommodation for children as young as two years. The home also facilitates their education starting from early childhood education through primary and high school. Donations towards this project will benefit 50 OVC children by providing them with education, free nutritious meals, upkeep and a suitable living environment to call home.</narrative>
  </description>
